From: Claude <assistant@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 10:48:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 1 (5, 7, 8): header signup/signin buttons, mobile
 back/home nav, admin-editable site pages
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Header: explicit Sign in / Sign up buttons for logged-out users (item 5)
- Item 6 (shop-by-age drawer) dropped per instruction — never built, nothing removed
- New MobileSubNav component: mobile-only Back + Home bar under header, hidden on homepage (item 7)
- New site_pages table + admin CRUD (canManagePages permission) so About Us, Privacy Policy,
  Terms, and Shipping & Returns can be edited from admin without a dev — covers the online-store
  vs physical-store wording difference for About Us (item 8)
- New public pages: /our-story, /privacy-policy, /terms, /shipping-returns, all rendering from site_pages
- Footer rebuilt: fixed two dead links (/our-story, /shipping-returns previously 404'd), added
  Help Center, Report an Issue, Privacy Policy, Terms links
- Admin nav: added 'Site Pages' link gated by canManagePages
